      <h2>Key Features</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>100% Original Files:</strong> Files are fetched directly from Google servers.</li>
        <li><strong>Bypass Region Locks:</strong> Download apps that are not available in your country.</li>
        <li><strong>OBB & Data Support:</strong> Download supported large games with their extra files.</li>
        <li><strong>Device Compatibility:</strong> Works for phones, tablets, Android TV, and emulators.</li>
        <li><strong>Custom Architecture:</strong> Advanced users can choose specific APK variants.</li>
        <li><strong>No Login Required:</strong> You do not need to sign in.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Use MI9 APK Downloader?</h2>
      <p>While the Google Play Store is convenient, sometimes you need more control. Our tool is useful for users who need direct APK access, better compatibility options, or downloads for unsupported devices.</p>

